# tests/infra/run-all-ambient-vars.manifest — the single acknowledged ledger
# of every env var ambiently injected into the run_all.sh pool (every one of
# its ~103 tests inherits ALL of these, whether or not a given test cares
# about a given var).
#
# Co-maintained with the two live injection sources:
#   - scripts/verify.sh's run_all.sh plan line (verify.sh:1430): a prefix env
#     hardcoded onto the `bash tests/infra/run_all.sh` command.
#   - dark-factory-orchestrator.yaml's verify_env block (dark-factory-orchestrator.yaml:148-152):
#     exported into the whole verify.sh process tree by the orchestrator.
#
# tests/infra/test_run_all_ambient_isolation.sh derives the LIVE injected-var
# set from both sources above and cross-checks it against this file's key set
# for SET EQUALITY. A var newly added to either source without a matching
# entry here (or a stale entry here for a var no longer injected) fails that
# guard's drift assertion — so extending either injection source requires a
# conscious edit to this ledger. The same guard also drives a per-var
# hostile-ambient sub-case (real test_run_all.sh run once per var, with every
# other ledger var unset) off this file's key set.
#
# Format: one env-var name per line. `#`-comment and blank lines ignored.
# Values are NOT recorded here (this is a keys-only ledger) — each guard run
# looks up the live value from whichever injection source actually carries
# that key.

# --- run_all.sh plan-line prefix env (verify.sh:1430) -----------------------
# Coverage caveat (task 5152): REIFY_AUDIT_NO_COLD_BUILD's hostile-ambient
# sub-case in test_run_all_ambient_isolation.sh passes vacuously regardless
# of whether an isolation bug exists for it -- setting it to 1 makes the
# reify-audit freshness guard SKIP rather than fail (verify.sh:1410-1412),
# so test_run_all.sh exits 0 either way. Listing it here still closes the
# LEDGER-DRIFT gap (this var can no longer silently go untracked if either
# injection source changes); it does not by itself prove isolation-bug
# coverage for this var the way REIFY_RUN_ALL_EXCLUDE_HOST_INFRA's sub-case
# does.
REIFY_AUDIT_NO_COLD_BUILD
REIFY_RUN_ALL_EXCLUDE_HOST_INFRA
# REIFY_RUN_ALL_CONTENT_SKIP (task 5273, merge-gate-riders γ): arms the
# merge-tier content-addressed per-member skip engine in run_all.sh. Injected by
# the SAME run_all.sh plan-line prefix in scripts/verify.sh (both live source and
# ledger row co-land in γ, satisfying the set-equality guard). Its sibling
# REIFY_RUN_ALL_SKIP_STATE (the durable state-ledger path that flips the engine
# from inert to active) is supplied by the activation task (δ / 5276): its live
# source is dark-factory-orchestrator.yaml's verify_env block, so its ledger row
# is declared in the verify_env section below, next to REIFY_RUN_ALL_FLAKY_LEDGER.
REIFY_RUN_ALL_CONTENT_SKIP

# --- dark-factory-orchestrator.yaml verify_env block (dark-factory-orchestrator.yaml:148-152) ---------
# REIFY_RUN_ALL_EXCLUDE_HOST_INFRA already declared above (both sources carry
# it). CARGO_MAKEFLAGS is deliberately excluded: owned solely by verify.sh's
# apply_env() (contract C3 / task 4518 delta), not injected by verify_env.
REIFY_GATE_EXCLUDE_HEAVY
RUSTC_WRAPPER
CARGO_INCREMENTAL
REIFY_TEST_SEMAPHORE_CONCURRENCY
REIFY_TEST_SEMAPHORE_WAIT
REIFY_PSI_GATE_MAX_WAIT

# Added by bc235a616a (merge-gate-health W5a, 2026-07-19): durable FLAKY-ledger
# path exported into verify_env so the Phase-2.5 ledger survives lane reseeds and
# accumulates at the merge tier (DF 2358's chronic-flake auto-filer). That commit
# added it to the verify_env injection source but not to this ledger, tripping the
# set-equality guard deterministically on every task's full verify — declared here
# to close that drift.
REIFY_RUN_ALL_FLAKY_LEDGER

# Durable content-skip state-ledger path (merge-gate-riders δ / task 5276, PRD §4.3):
# exported into verify_env (dark-factory-orchestrator.yaml) so the keys-only skip
# ledger survives warm-lane reseeds and accumulates per-member green shas at the merge
# tier. Its live source is the yaml verify_env block (like FLAKY_LEDGER above); this
# row co-lands in δ's diff to keep test_run_all_ambient_isolation.sh's set-equality
# guard balanced. Flips run_all.sh's γ-landed content-skip engine from inert to active.
REIFY_RUN_ALL_SKIP_STATE

# Sweep-gated delta-conditional release-pass skip activation flag
# (merge-gate-riders ζ / task 5280, PRD §5.3): exported into verify_env
# (dark-factory-orchestrator.yaml) so verify.sh's _RELEASE_DELTA_SKIP decision
# block (role=merge only) can omit the release nextest pass on a delta-clean
# merge. This row co-lands with the yaml knob in the SAME commit to keep
# test_run_all_ambient_isolation.sh's set-equality guard balanced (the yaml
# knob alone trips the live-var-not-in-ledger check; this row alone trips the
# ledger-var-not-live check).
REIFY_RELEASE_DELTA_SKIP

# Toolchain-cache unification with the sandboxed agent roles (task 5836):
# verify_env now carries CARGO_HOME so the merge-gate build, the landlock-
# sandboxed agents and verify all resolve the SAME registry source paths — cargo's
# per-unit fingerprint embeds that absolute path, so a split made each side dirty
# the other's units in a warm lane's shared target/. Its live source is the yaml
# verify_env block (like FLAKY_LEDGER / SKIP_STATE above); this row co-lands with
# that yaml line in the SAME commit to keep test_run_all_ambient_isolation.sh's
# set-equality guard balanced (the yaml line alone trips the live-var-not-in-ledger
# check; this row alone trips the ledger-var-not-live check). Full coupling
# analysis: the header of tests/infra/test_sandbox_cache_writability_seam.sh.
#
# Coverage caveat, same shape as REIFY_AUDIT_NO_COLD_BUILD's above: this row buys
# LEDGER-DRIFT coverage only and adds NO hostile-ambient sub-case. The re-run loop
# is driven off HOSTILE_LOOP_KEYS (test_run_all_ambient_isolation.sh:322), an
# explicit allow-list whose sole member is REIFY_RUN_ALL_EXCLUDE_HOST_INFRA —
# a deliberate SUBSET of this ledger since task 5152's reviewer follow-up (a
# full-ledger loop paid ~8x wall-clock for no additional isolation-bug coverage).
# Adding this key here does not enrol it in that loop, and must not be read as
# proving test_run_all.sh is isolated against an ambient CARGO_HOME.
CARGO_HOME
